// Dash Ascension (Afterbeat) - added by AfterbeatSkillAction.Begin when Zara's dash starts, ticked
// down by ZaraAfterbeatSystem. Stores the delayed pulse's own position/damage/radius directly on
// Zara's own entity rather than spawning a separate marker entity - simpler than the other heroes'
// "needs a standalone EntityPrototype authored by hand" dash ascensions (Kai's SlowArea, Lux's
// Decoy Beacon, Brute's Barricade, Pixie's Bombs Away), since this needs no physical/visual
// representation of its own, just a countdown. A second dash before the first Afterbeat fires
// simply overwrites the pending one - only the most recent dash's Afterbeat ever lands.
component ZaraAfterbeat
{
    FP Remaining;
    FPVector3 Position;
    FP Damage;
    FP Radius;
}
